        "step_WXmWKR": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Step 2",
            "title": "Pattern cutting and assembly",
            "heading_font_size": "heading-medium",
            "text": "<p>Cutting is the next step where the leathers and materials are cut to shape and size according to the design of the shoe. This is a critical step in the process as it determines how the final product will look.</p><p>After the pattern cutting, the next stage is assembly. This is where all the pieces of the shoe are put together to form the final product. This stage is where the shoemaker's skill and expertise come into play as they put together all the different parts of the shoe.</p><p>Every shoe that leaves our workshop is an instant piece of artwork. The soul and shape of your shoe has been carefully constructed to be passed on. The artisans in charge will make sure the highest quality possible- only when this happens does it become your new acquisition!</p><p>Every time you buy from us, no matter how small or large the purchase might be; Your customized pair becomes part one among many other unique treasures waiting patiently behind closed doors here at ADORSI Brand.</p>",
            "text_font_size": "body-medium",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/golf_shoes_20.png",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "button_type": "btn--primary",
