        "step_LXpExQ": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Step 4",
            "title": "Patina workshop",
            "heading_font_size": "heading-medium",
            "text": "<p>Even when you're not a fan of shoe polish, this is way more than just another shine. </p><p>ADORSI hand-painted patina finishing is the crème de la crème of the handcrafting process. To achieve an aged, uniquely charming weathered look to their leather goods the process consists of carefully applying hand-painted layers. </p><p>The result of this unique artisanal precise bespoke process is a one-of-a-kind piece that cannot be replicated.</p>",
