        "step_wGGywQ": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Step 5",
            "title": "Finishing & Quality Control",
            "heading_font_size": "heading-medium",
            "text": "<p>The finishing process for your shoe is a series of operations. The first step in the process includes painting all soles, according to what color you have chosen on top-notch leathers like ours! </p><p>Polishing is an important stage in the production of shoes.</p><p> This stage includes manual cleaning and polishing of both upper materials as well as the sole unit. It's done to remove any impurities from leather, which helps maintain its quality and improves how it looks on your foot!<br/><br/>After the final stage of production, the last check is made to ensure that each shoe meets our high standards. Once they pass this quality control test, they are finally ready to be packaged and shipped off to their new owner!</p>",
