            "title": "Packaging",
            "heading_font_size": "heading-medium",
            "text": "<p>When you open the box, the first thing you will see is your new shoes, wrapped in an ADORSI dust bag and placed side by side. On top of that, you will find a shoehorn.</p><p>We recommend that you take your time to unwrap your new shoes and enjoy the experience. Inspect them closely and appreciate the craftsmanship that went into making them.</p><p>Once you have inspected your new shoes, we suggest that you put them on and walk around in them to get a feel for how they fit. If you are not satisfied with the fit, please contact us so that we can assist you further.</p><p>We hope that you enjoy your new shoes and the experience of unboxing them!</p>",
